      "@type": "VisualMaterial",
      "instance_name": "baby",
      "label": "child",
      "description": "A young infant, shirtless and wearing a white diaper, is standing on a tiled floor in front of an open dishwasher. The baby is facing away from the camera, looking into the dishwasher, with its hands near the interior racks. The child appears to be interacting with or observing the dishwasher, creating a humorous juxtaposition with the text 'dss' overlaid in the top-left corner, which stands for 'doing the dishes.' The baby's posture and focus suggest curiosity or engagement with the appliance.",
