      "label": "Infantilization Stereotype",
      "description": "The meme relies on the stereotype that children are incapable of performing adult tasks, and humorously suggests the baby is 'doing the dishes' (dss), which infantilizes the child by implying they are mature enough to handle an adult chore. This can be seen as demeaning or mocking the baby's innocence and perceived maturity.",
