      "@type": "SemioticProjection",
      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the baby in the scene",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the baby (VisualMaterial entity) as the subject performing the implied action of 'doing the dishes' (dss). The meme humorously suggests the user (or the viewer) is identifying with the baby's role in the scene, creating a playful, self-referential projection where the viewer imagines themselves as the baby engaging in the adult chore. This projection is implicit, relying on the viewer's identification with the infantile subject in the image.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
